1. ALL DIMENSIONS ARE IN MILLIMETRES UNLESS NOTED OTHERWISE.\P2. DO NOT SCALE FROM THIS DRAWING - USE FIGURED DIMENSIONS ONLY.\P3. ALL OPENING SIZES / LEVELS TO BE VERIFIED AT SITE BEFORE FABRICATION.\P4. READ THIS DRAWING WITH THE ARCHITECTURAL / ST
  3
RUCTURAL DRAWINGS AND SPECIFICATION.\P5. ALUMINIUM: 6063-T6 EXTRUSIONS, POWDER COATED (COLOUR AS APPROVED SAMPLE).\P6. GLASS: 6mm CLEAR FULLY TEMPERED, EDGES POLISHED.\P7. FIXINGS: STAINLESS STEEL GRADE A2 (SS304) UNLESS NOTED.\P8. PERIMETER: PU FOAM
  1
 + SILICONE WEATHER SEAL ON BACKER ROD, BOTH FACES.\P9. PROFILE GEOMETRY IS INDICATIVE - REFER SYSTEM SUPPLIER CATALOGUE.
